}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"0bcafdb1e7f1ac1d6fc4803a38415447a0d9b70c000723bedec29d166876c677","event_uuid":"cabb92fa-37e7-4250-859c-dff20c849705","position":{"commit_sha":"43ae40a1a0fb3f1302efd7b62f0466d41fe1df86","position":"1787506221408951001-cabb92fa-37e7-4250-859c-dff20c849705"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"d83522903c395f52ceafc33a8bd0b2491b1b9130fb9ee96c2a7f47b52af41eac","event_uuid":"7b38a9eb-4a3f-42e6-9b6b-f80a23816ec6","position":{"commit_sha":"fa5660c89b479fb2c77cc879884e6608531c1185","position":"1787506245126270001-7b38a9eb-4a3f-42e6-9b6b-f80a23816ec6"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"c5eaf6cbad4aae3ffc2d131f10ea30a89426a31b5c33836fb9e5300860ad6b46","event_uuid":"6b13052f-1b40-4752-ade5-f5d750289aed","position":{"commit_sha":"df7a6ea8706e6f19b887a598a14ed4bde2ffec72","position":"1787506308319121001-6b13052f-1b40-4752-ade5-f5d750289aed"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Phase 1 / Step 0 orientation\n- Step 0(a): tracker sweep for \"tickets branch size\", \"tickets-store growth\", \"repository size\", \"reconciler growth\", and open/in-progress bugs found closed epic censual-organic-mouflon (0303-692c-55dc-4a18), which claimed a fresh clone <=150 MB after reclaim. This report is treated as a regression and linked duplicates; the prior diagnosis is evidence, not an assumed cause.\n- Step 0(b): no version was quoted; ticket created_at 1787506178295653001 gives reported-on-or-after floor ce496143fe1f72a07efeb0173da37013262ec446. No commits exist from that floor to origin/main in src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler or src/rebar/_store.\n- Step 0(c): fresh debug worktree HEAD ce496143fe1f72a07efeb0173da37013262ec446 exactly equals origin/main.\nTriage: full protocol. Multiple live alternatives remain (remote reachable history, local unreachable pre-rewrite objects/reflogs, ref pins, renewed reconciler churn, high commit/tree volume, or another path), so the fast path is not justified.","timestamp":1787506308319121001}],"created_at":1787506178295653001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"cabb92fa-37e7-4250-859c-dff20c849705","relation":"duplicates","target_id":"0303-692c-55dc-4a18"}],"description":"## Context\nThe tickets branch/store is reported over 1 GiB after closed epic censual-organic-mouflon claimed a one-time history rewrite reduced a fresh unfiltered clone to <=150 MB and bounded reconciler cache churn. Prior history implicates reconciler operations, but this investigation must not assume that diagnosis still explains current retained bytes.\n\n## Plan\n- Distinguish remote branch reachability, local shared-object storage, working-tree size, and unreachable/reflog-pinned objects.\n- Measure object counts and packed/delta-compressed bytes by type, path, commit/time interval, producer/commit shape, and ref reachability.\n- Reproduce the size from a fresh unfiltered clone or otherwise prove the report is local-retention behavior.\n- Compare current growth with the prior reclaim baseline and test reconciler churn against competing hypotheses such as high commit/tree volume, snapshots/events, signatures, merge topology, ref pins, and unreachable pre-rewrite history.\n- Trace any confirmed growth mechanism to the exact changeable artifact and originating ticket/commit; record an evidence-backed RCA only. No production-code repair is authorized in this ticket.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Current size is quantified separately for fresh remote reachability, local shared object storage, checkout contents, and unreachable/pinned objects.\n- [ ] Retained bytes are attributed by Git object type and historical path with reproducible commands.\n- [ ] The reconciler hypothesis and plausible alternatives each receive falsifiable tests, with outcomes recorded.\n- [ ] The result explains whether the prior reclaim failed, regressed, or remains effective while another mechanism accounts for the observation.\n- [ ] The confirmed root cause and defect origin (or rigorous unattributable finding) are recorded on this ticket with residual risks.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"none","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"Read-only root-cause investigation; no repository files will be modified.","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"2e4deaed-cca7-4b0e-9544-6be468d16b99","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["store","git","reconciler","regression"],"ticket_id":"f9ee-5ad5-4a78-4147","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Regression investigation: tickets branch/store exceeds 1 GiB after history reclaim","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["cfa35591-1ee8-4636-8a05-d64581e3c38d","2e4deaed-cca7-4b0e-9544-6be468d16b99","ca0f1930-337a-4802-a818-407b4d1b158e","cabb92fa-37e7-4250-859c-dff20c849705","7b38a9eb-4a3f-42e6-9b6b-f80a23816ec6","6b13052f-1b40-4752-ade5-f5d750289aed"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787508318129755363,"uuid":"83a89225-d7c6-454c-92c4-30c643038dbc"}